{"ts":"2026-09-12T17:40:00+05:30","command":"/personal-3d-pager","decision":"rebuilt the landing on React + R3F + drei + GSAP as a lazily-mounted island inside the Svelte app, aliased out of native builds entirely","reason":"user chose the full 3D-genre stack after being advised against it. The 'naive' complaint was real and specific: untextured BoxGeometry cubes at the same scale as the people, nothing grounded by AO, a 5% tonal band and no post-processing. drei Environment/ContactShadows plus N8AO/Bloom/Vignette are the levers that fix exactly that. Cost: a 506 KB gz lazy chunk. Initial app bundle untouched at 118.61 kB.","overrides":"advised option 1; user selected option 3"}
